# Code quality

- Handle loading, empty, and error states on data and list screens.
- For audio: handle play, pause, seek, progress, loading, errors, and unload/cleanup on close and unmount.
- Do not leave `console.log`, commented-out blocks, unused props, or dead styles in finished work.
- Validate before save (required fields, recording present). Confirm destructive actions (delete).
- Persist durable data only (copy recordings out of cache/temp before storing URIs).
- After major changes run `npm run lint` and briefly list files changed + what was implemented.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
export const PreviewModal = (props: any) => { console.log(props); return null; };

// ✅ GOOD
type PreviewModalProps = {
  uri: string | null;
  onClose: () => void;
};
export const PreviewModal = ({ uri, onClose }: PreviewModalProps) => { /* ... */ };
```
